WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.134 --> 00:00:06.315
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:06.316 --> 00:00:11.428
What do they see?

3
00:00:11.429 --> 00:00:20.854
They see a house of mirrors!

4
00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:40.100
The blobs run inside.

5
00:00:40.101 --> 00:00:49.752
They see big blobs.

6
00:00:49.753 --> 00:01:04.131
They see small blobs.

7
00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:18.638
They see tall blobs.

8
00:01:18.639 --> 00:01:30.385
They see short blobs.

9
00:01:30.386 --> 00:01:45.952
They see thin blobs.

10
00:01:45.953 --> 00:01:57.208
They see wide blobs.

11
00:01:57.209 --> 00:02:03.508
Blobs, what do you see now?

12
00:02:03.509 --> 00:02:10.128
They see many, many, many blobs.

13
00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:16.349
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:19.758
Good-bye!

